ts of Operations","block":824,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-25-103098","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2025-10-28","reportDate":"2025-07-31","cik":"0001667313","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1667313/000121390025103098/ea0262035-10k_zedge.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8c4a7997734b236996fe4f63223704a401d445d56affac69bd81af782b6af932.bin","sha256":"8c4a7997734b236996fe4f63223704a401d445d56affac69bd81af782b6af932"}},{"id":"7db943bcf86e0c2462c3a591c49f31888f7ff2aa7c14697c4b3b91c6c008df5c","quote":"On October 28, 2022, we entered into an Amended Loan Agreement with Western Alliance Bank. Pursuant to the Amended Loan Agreement, Western Alliance Bank agreed to provide the Company with a new term loan facility in the maximum principal amount of $7 million for a four-year term and a $4 million revolving credit facility for a two-year term. Pursuant to the Amended Loan Agreement, $2 million was advanced in a single-cash advance on the closing date on October 28, 2022.","context":"Financing Activities","section":"Comparison of our Segment Results of Operations","block":826,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-25-103098","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2025-10-28","reportDate":"2025-07-31","cik":"0001667313","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1667313/000121390025103098/ea0262035-10k_zedge.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8c4a7997734b236996fe4f63223704a401d445d56affac69bd81af782b6af932.bin","sha256":"8c4a7997734b236996fe4f63223704a401d445d56affac69bd81af782b6af932"}},{"id":"54cebcb756da2646b5d386365010f2d3509e2807f9a4ff89578e959ec03c1fac","quote":"At our request, the maximum principal amount of the term loan was reduced from $7 million to $2 million as of May 11, 2023. On November 15, 2023, the Company voluntarily prepaid the entire principal amount of $2 million in accordance with the terms of the Amended Loan Agreement without incurring any prepayment penalty.","context":"On October 28, 2022, we entered into an Amended Loan Agreement with Western Alliance Bank. Pursuant to the Amended Loan Agreement, Western Alliance Bank agreed to provide the Company with a new term loan facility in the maximum principal amount of $7 million for a four-year term and a $4 million revolving credit facility for a two-year term. Pursuant to the Amended Loan Agreement, $2 million was advanced in a single-cash advance on the closing date on October 28, 2022.","section":"Comparison of our Segment Results of Operations","block":827,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-25-103098","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2025-10-28","reportDate":"2025-07-31","cik":"0001667313","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1667313/000121390025103098/ea0262035-10k_zedge.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8c4a7997734b236996fe4f63223704a401d445d56affac69bd81af782b6af932.bin","sha256":"8c4a7997734b236996fe4f63223704a401d445d56affac69bd81af782b6af932"}},{"id":"d8c7bc40fa6b9166e881ae92007e436e3061a8044a465f0451da9a8f08168fed","quote":"On October 28, 2024, the revolving credit facility was renewed for another four years term, please see Note 16, Revolving Credit Facility, to the Consolidated Financial Statements in Part II, Item 8 of this Annual Report on Form 10-K.","context":"At our request, the maximum principal amount of the term loan was reduced from $7 million to $2 million as of May 11, 2023. On November 15, 2023, the Company voluntarily prepaid the entire principal amount of $2 million in accordance with the terms of the Amended Loan Agreement without incurring any prepayment penalty.","section":"Comparison of our Segment Results of Operations","block":828,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"a